Package: agent-security-runtime
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, ca-certificates
Recommends: docker.io
Maintainer: SawanoHao <sawanohao@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SawanoHao/agent-security-runtime
Description: Agent Security Runtime control plane
 Ubuntu security runtime for multi-agent setups (DSH / OpenClaw / Hermes).
 Provides OpenShell bridging, YAML policy, skill scanning, Tev1-0.8B risk
 screening, an installer journey, and a local WebUI console on :8787.
 .
 Installs CLI wrappers `asr` and `asr-setup`. First launch opens the
 setup wizard at http://127.0.0.1:8787 .
